<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="08_dimension_groups" name="Nhóm Dimension"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2300" pageHeight="1450" background="#f7f9fc"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="NHÓM 13  /  TV4  /  L4-03" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#235eaa;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="28" width="2200" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Nhóm Dimension theo vai trò phân tích" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=36;fontColor=#16273d;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="62" width="2200" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Phân nhóm Dimension cho DW G2 · phần có trong DDL TV3 (liền nét) và phần chưa có (nét đứt) · REVIEW, chưa PASS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#52647a;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="118" width="2200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n4" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CÓ TRONG G2 · PROPOSED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhóm 1 — Thời gian&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;dim_month  (dùng chung cả 3 Fact)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vai trò (role-playing):&lt;br&gt;• snapshot  — snapshot_yyyymm của Employment&lt;br&gt;• report    — tháng của file nguồn (inventory)&lt;br&gt;• effective — personnel_action_effective_date_yyyymm&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hierarchy: calendar_year → calendar_month&lt;br&gt;Unknown: month_key = 0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dùng bởi: Employment (snapshot, report), Accessions và Separations (report, effective)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#eef4fc;strokeColor=#235eaa;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="190" width="700" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n5" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CÓ TRONG G2 · PARTIAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhóm 2 — Tổ chức&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;dim_agency  (dùng chung cả 3 Fact)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Khóa: (month_key, agency_code); agency_key khác nhau theo tháng&lt;br&gt;So sánh nhiều tháng: nhóm theo agency_code&lt;br&gt;Nhãn từ lookup TV2; chỉ nhãn READY được dùng&lt;br&gt;Unknown: agency_key = 0&lt;br&gt;  tháng 04: 206.687 Employment / 1.591 Accessions / 1.936 Separations&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hierarchy: CHƯA vẽ (chờ TV2 xác minh agency, sub-element, department)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#eef4fc;strokeColor=#235eaa;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="800" y="190" width="700" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CÓ TRONG G2 · PARTIAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhóm 3 — Hành động nhân sự&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;dim_action_category  (chỉ Fact sự kiện)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Một bảng, cột family tách:&lt;br&gt;• accessions  ← accession_category / _code&lt;br&gt;• separations ← separation category / _code&lt;br&gt;• unknown&lt;br&gt;Khóa: (month_key, family, category_code)&lt;br&gt;Unknown: category_key = 0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Luôn lọc đúng family khi dùng với từng Fact&lt;br&gt;Hierarchy: family → category_code&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#fdf3e6;strokeColor=#c0680f;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="1550" y="190" width="700" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Ứng viên chưa có trong DW G2 (không đưa vào slicer chính cho đến khi TV2 audit và TV3 thêm vào DDL)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#16273d;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="785" width="2200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHƯA CÓ · UNSUPPORTED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cấp bậc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;pay_plan + grade (cặp)&lt;br&gt;grade đơn lẻ không có FK riêng&lt;br&gt;pay_plan NULL: 366 / 2.488 / 2.444 / 2.430 dòng (4 tháng)&lt;br&gt;Không vẽ hierarchy&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa8ba;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="830" width="520" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHƯA CÓ · REDACTED ~46%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Địa điểm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;duty_station (code, city, state, country)&lt;br&gt;Hơn 17.000 giá trị; tháng 03: 1.050.981 / 2.289.192 dòng REDACTED&lt;br&gt;Không làm slicer chính, không bản đồ&lt;br&gt;Không vẽ hierarchy&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa8ba;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry x="610" y="830" width="520" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHƯA CÓ · chờ audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nghề nghiệp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;occupational_category / group / series&lt;br&gt;Chỉ thêm khi TV2 đánh dấu verified&lt;br&gt;Chưa có lookup tham chiếu&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa8ba;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="830" width="520" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n11" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#235eaa&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHƯA CÓ · chưa phân tích&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhân khẩu và công việc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;age_bracket · education_level&lt;br&gt;appointment_type · length_of_service&lt;br&gt;Có trong ODS; chưa kiểm cho DW&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa8ba;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry x="1730" y="830" width="520" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n12" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot; color=&quot;#16273d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nguyên tắc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot; color=&quot;#52647a&quot;&gt;• Dimension chưa được TV2 audit ghi PARTIAL; không tự vẽ hierarchy Agency / Location / Grade.&lt;br&gt;• Các Fact chỉ nối qua Dimension dùng chung (tháng, agency); không nối Fact với Fact.&lt;br&gt;• Mọi nhóm Unknown (key 0) phải hiện rõ trên dashboard, không ẩn khỏi tổng toàn kỳ.&lt;br&gt;• Chi tiết cột, khóa và quy tắc Unknown: docs/08_dimension_catalog.csv; ma trận Fact × Dimension: docs/09_bus_matrix.md.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c4d1e1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="50" y="1170" width="2200" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
